---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { contact, site } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  current="privacy"
  title="Privacy information"
  description="How the Colton & Colwich T’ai Chi website handles information: no forms, accounts, cookies or tracking, and what happens when you contact Andrew."
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy information</h1>
      <p class="lead">This page explains what information this website collects and how we use the details you share when you contact us.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a community group led by {site.instructor}. We offer affordable tuition on a non-profit basis. You can contact us by email at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or by telephone on {contact.phones.map((p, i) => (<>{i > 0 && ' or '}<a href={`tel:${p.tel}`}>{p.display}</a></>))}.
      </p>

      <h2>Information this website collects</h2>
      <p>
        This website has no contact forms, booking system, member accounts or mailing list. It does not set cookies and does not use
        analytics or advertising tracking. Fonts and images are served from the website itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        Netlify hosts this website and may process technical information, such as your IP address, when you visit. For details, see{' '}
        <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify’s privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>When you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you email, phone or message us, we use your details to reply and to arrange your visit to a class. We do not use them for
        marketing. The providers of the email or messaging services we use also process these communications.
      </p>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry messages for up to three months in case you get back in touch, then delete them. We keep the class register
        for two years.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>
        Our practice videos are hosted on YouTube, and we link to Facebook, Google Maps, Colton Village Hall and the T’ai Chi &amp;
        Internal Arts Union. Those websites have their own privacy and cookie policies, which apply once you follow a link.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by contacting Andrew using the details
        above. If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, you can contact the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/">Information Commissioner’s Office</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: 7 November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lead { font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.1rem + 0.45vw, 1.35rem); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--h3); margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .updated { margin-top: var(--space-4); color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
